    "created_at": "2023-03-23T08:12:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-03-23T08:12:21Z",
    "body": "I have a preference for simple exceptions, but I don't have a good justification for it.\r\n\r\nI think the compatibility risk for changing this would probably be minimal, but I don't have a way of measuring it.\r\n\r\n@domenic Can I ask you for an opinion?",
